{"data":{"body":"[P1] Reject persisted containers when the current child is virtual\n\nWhen `ChildConfig(is_virtual=True)` replays history from a non-virtual child, the container has the same identity, so this lookup accepts it and terminal handling returns the cached value without running the virtual body or validating its changed inner parents. Reject any existing checkpoint when `self.is_virtual` before terminal handling\u2014ideally before replay hooks\u2014and add a non-virtual-to-virtual replay test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7p6S3S","finding_digest":"856e8305ec1ad93cdd36952739c09f74587b246a0c47360b9f8d015fd8f3922a","finding_id":"arf_v1_qvxigbpmdlmtzxjwsutttqe7or","finding_key":"operation/child.py::childoperationexecutor.check_result_status::virtual-mode-must-not-consume-container-checkpoints","identity_key":"operation/child.py::childoperationexecutor.check_result_status::virtual-mode-must-not-consume-container-checkpoints","line":86,"observation_digest":"7e6ea1fe086f558b9771b9b3ca3e05abb2e1a7dca7a032c0d6be74b1379d3089","observation_id":"aro_v1_pzxkd7qin5kyxf3rxgz4upqfvo","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python/operation/child.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_qvxigbpmdlmtzxjwsutttqe7or","published_at":"2026-09-03T12:12:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wvjuvizb3fvadrhaqd3qu3c3do","reviewed_base_sha":"0b6b702cb6f5ddb5caaa84258704515814935938","reviewed_head_sha":"7216ea0d3b5411fcac2a5bbbf94e6a22d27d2a1e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":86,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":698},"record_id":"art_v1_oupcmvxhz2m2bq2j4bxkywcsrl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T12:12:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
